<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="SNG" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Meng Klo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Meng Klo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Meng Klo</para>
  <para style="mt1">Meng Klo</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow Sawlawmawn chekhai, now arui khin dow 965 BC khe chekhai. Mang Sawlawmawn mih aia chownglawng kowi ruila meng 1,005 klüng chekhai. Nami lawnguan dow 1 Manguüa 4:32 uan kowi arui uowi. Aia ruiah mih meng maten kowi kowh lang klangiung mih meng dow mami chekhai. Mami bowih dow Jihudiuüa mih bowkbowk lak-e kowh lang iuk mih Takat Pawi pami pawi khe phatah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi dow masi huaiu natasakrau mih lawnguan kowi arui uowi chekhai. Masiuüa dow kachakuüa betmaram hut hown kowh pawah mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi masi huaiu dow pabuk panga sang chekhai. Masi huaiu tasakrau iawng krista paw lang haw miuüa kowi sakrau pami natukla kownkow mami bowih lainowmma iung chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih dow chup pe Thurai now naphatah kown mih lakke. Masi huaiu lawnguan kowi che klangiungma a-i tuk hanow Thurai hown kowh aia maru-uüa tachawk tatawmra lawnguan kowi paw klangiungma a-i natuk kown. Masi huaiu lawnguan kowi dow Hosea 2:19-23 hai Ephesi 5:23-32 kowi arui uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Changla masi mih narma: Changla masi mih narma pami dow masi ching nadowi chekhai. Naiawng mih masi dow masi ching iawng dawngthawnguan napowng kown mih alow tawi ka dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Dalim: Dalim pami dow uih chap chekhai. Dalim uih dow apik amachow panow alak chak mih anuk iawng kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Tachawng dowi rawn lowkkowlowk narik tatuk kown mih 1:1-3:5</para>
  <para style="io1">Tachawng kung kowi taphua taiua mih lawnguan 3:6-5:1</para>
  <para style="io1">Lowkkowlowk taking tasang dowi khe kowh naplan taking tasang kown mih lawnguan 5:2-8:4</para>
  <para style="io1">Tasakrau mih amatra hai laikham 8:5-14</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="SNG 1" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 1:1" />Mami dow mang Sawlawmawn kowh meng maten kowi kowh lang iung mih meng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aia sakraura malauüa tüng mih</para>
  <para style="sp">Malauüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 1:2" />Aw ang kowh klanguüa, ang kowi krawi sur krawi nam ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:2">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh sakraura dow grep tui lak-e lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 1:3" />En phawkah mih sau nam hown dow ang sak sowr lai kowbow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:3">en kowh ming iung dow en phawkah mih anam iungma mih sau iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 1:3">Naiawng rakowi malauüa hawmh dow naukhi en khai.<verse eid="SNG 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 1:4" />Mang kowi ang tek pe mih, “Sakkrowng bowt, ang kowh mang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:4">sakkrowng bowt, pawla ang bowt,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 1:4">Nahanow mang dow aia kim kowi pawla ang khai.</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 1:4">Jerusalem masiuüa hawmh kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 1:4">Anging dow en hown naawmrawm hai napiaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:4">grep tui lak-e en kowh sakraura kowi anging nalang kiow en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 1:4">Amatni naukhi en mih dow lainowmma na chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Malauüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 1:5" />Aw Jerusalem masiuüa hawmh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:5">ang dow anumma chepaw klangiungma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 1:5">Ang dow Kedar kowi kowh tangbung iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:5">ang dow Sawlawmawn kowh tangbung uaniang iawng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 1:6" />Ang num khai pache naiawng amik sang hauang mü ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:6">ang num mih dow sat den ang lai kowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 1:6">Ang rakmauüa dow kunmarau rakowi pe mingkhet ang grep krum khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:6">Naiawng rakowi ang kowh kow mih klangiungma ang ia mingkhet dowi chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 1:7" />Aw ang kowh klanguüa, tek ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:7">tawng kowi chow en kowh ruapur hawmh kowi en cham thingah?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:7">Now sat downg khe tawng kowi chow en kowh ruapur hawmh kowi en cham pe tanaiah?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 1:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en hown taiua thing ruapur miuüa pungmadawng kowi uowi kown ang nau dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:7">amatni pungmadawng kowi chawkkrawma iawng uowi kown ang nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawlawmawn hai aia kowh manau piaw mih</para>
  <para style="sp">Klanguüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 1:8" />Aw lang klangiung mih malauüa, ang uowi rah che en tuk dowi hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:8">ruapur hawmh kowh khawk kung rowkrowk uang krawi uang bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:8">now ruapur thing miuüa tangbung re-e en kowh rua chauüa kowi thingah bowt.<verse eid="SNG 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 1:9" />Aw ang kowh manau, en dow kawrngama iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:9">en kowi dow mang Faraw kowh kari küng mih kawrngala maten ir en khai.<verse eid="SNG 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 1:10" />En kowh ramseng rakowi en kowh ngeupa mih lainowmma klangiung khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:10">now ngawng kowi paw keng ük lainowmma en lahawm khai.<verse eid="SNG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 1:11" />En vüi kowi dow anging nathawp en kuh ramseng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:11">nami kuh ramseng kowi dow tai hown nathawp pe bawng kown.<verse eid="SNG 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Malauüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 1:12" />Mawk rah kowi ang kowh mang mawk khe paingbawng nam mih krawi tahu suanglang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:12">mawk rah kowi ang kowh mang mawk khe ang kowh paingbawng nam mih krawi tauet khai.<verse eid="SNG 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 1:13" />Ang kowh klanguüa dow paingbawng towk müa im chah iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:13">nami im dow ang kowh iawn takra kowi ang towah reng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 1:14" />Ang kowh klanguüa dow paingbawng pau tuh iawng ang tut-e klangiungma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:14">Nami dow En-Gedi pami grep krum kowi kowh awr pau reng mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Klanguüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 1:15" />Aw ang kowh manau, en dow klangiung lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:15">En dow lainowmma klangiung khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 1:15">En kowh mik dow uatur iawng klangiungma chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Malauüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 1:16" />Aw ang kowh klanguüa, en dow klangiung lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:16">En dow lainowmma klangiung khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 1:16">Achi kowh mawk rah dow pram singma mih dawng kowi chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="SNG 1:17" />Sidar singh dow achi kowh kim klowng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 1:17">now karpowng singh dow achi kowh klawngdawng chüng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="SNG 2" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 2:1" />Ang dow Sarawn pami arah kowi kowh paingbawng pau iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:1">ang dow lawngrawi kowi kowh awr thar mih lili pau iawng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Klanguüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 2:2" />Ang kowh manau dow chuh mung kowi kowh awr pau mih lili pau iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:2">aia dow malauüa pungmadawng kowi kowh lang klangiung mih chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Malauüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 2:3" />Ang kowh manau dow kaurawng kowi kowh singh pungmadawng kowi apel singh iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:3">aia dow klanguüa pungmadawng kowi kowh lang klangiung mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 2:3">Ang dow aia kowh klim kowi piaw reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:3">aia kowh sakraura uih dow ang tut-e lainowmma ding chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 2:4" />Aia dow hawm chakra kim lak kowi pawla ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:4">now aia naukhi ang mih dow maru akawmma pur kowi phuangah khai.<verse eid="SNG 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 2:5" />Grep uih keu pe cha ang hanow pe ang kür diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:5">Apel uih pe cha ang hanow kow khawtma chang ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 2:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow naukhi en lai bowt kowh kow uak khai bowt.<verse eid="SNG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 2:6" />Aia kowh lakuai rut kowi dow ang nüa lu khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:6">now hawmlawm rut hown dow aia dawi ang khai.<verse eid="SNG 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 2:7" />Aw Jerusalem masiuüa, ngahiu hai dowm kowi kowh naki ming rükla se ang tek khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:7">akhin taka dowi mowr dow hang cham tanau büa diah.<verse eid="SNG 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aia manau kowi malauüa sakrauah mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 2:8" />Ang kowh klanguüa uaimang mih klow hawt sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:8">aia dow hungma mawngma luk iawng tapowrla dowklowk se uang haimang khowk.<verse eid="SNG 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 2:9" />Ang kowh klanguüa dow ngahiu hai naki chah iawng akürma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:9">Aia dow tap khung kowi iowng downglowng khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 2:9">Aia dow tawngpawk hownia haimü ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:9">aia dow tawngpawk kua hownia ku rua ang khai.<verse eid="SNG 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 2:10" />Ang kowh manau tek ang mih, “Ang kowh manau ow, rü bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:10">Klangiung ow, ang tut-e uang tawi bowt.<verse eid="SNG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 2:11" />Mü diah, chungrau khin prowng khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:11">now siadawng khin paw towng khai bowt.<verse eid="SNG 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 2:12" />Dowm kowi pau uang awr thar khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:12">uakling uaber hawmh kowh meng tek khin paw uang ting khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 2:12">Kaurawng uatur laiklow paw anging pren kowi ta khai bowt.<verse eid="SNG 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 2:13" />Uidut singh kowi uidut uih khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:13">grep ruih kowi kowh pau nam krawi tauet khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 2:13">Aw ang kowh manau, awr rü bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:13">klangiung ow, ang tut-e uang tawi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="SNG 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Klanguüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 2:14" />Aw ang kowh uatur, en dow hungh takra kowi tapet khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:14">en kowh lumowr tüng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:14">en kowh klow uang pe ta ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 2:14">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh kraw dow lainowmma iung khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:14">now en kowh powm paw lainowmma klangiung chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Jerusalem malauüa hawmh kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 2:15" />Nami brenkhui kowi khüm büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:15">now nami brenkhui chauüa kowi paw khüm büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 2:15">Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün dow krawi piak grep krum khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:15">anging kowh grep krum kowi grep pau chen kla thüm khowk.<verse eid="SNG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Malauüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 2:16" />Ang kowh klanguüa dow ang kowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:16">ang dow aia kowh malauüa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 2:16">Aia dow lili pau dawng kowi krawi mang khai.<verse eid="SNG 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="SNG 2:17" />Aw ang kowh klanguüa, ang tut-e uang plan bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 2:17">hungh luk kowi kowh ngahiu hai naki chah iawng uang plan bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 2:17">Uar thowi dowi mowr ang re-e tawi uowila ang diah.<verse eid="SNG 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="SNG 3" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 3:1" />Iak-e khe mawk rah kowi ang kowh klanguüa kowi ang prüa khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 3:1">Nachenganchepaw aia dow uang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 3:2" />Kawmat awr rü hanow ang kowh klanguüa kowi marow kowi krawi cham kown mih ang ka tuak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 3:2">marow kowi kowh tiama towng hai viadawng kowi krawi cham kown mih ang ka tuak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 3:2">Now aia kowi dow cham paw ang krawi cham khowk chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 3:2">Nachenganchepaw aia kowi ang krum dowi chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 3:3" />Ang kowi dow marow kowi kowh kangchawng miuüa krawi len khe khita ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 3:3">Nakhowk khe amatni kowi ang lüntaah mih, “Ang kowh klanguüa kowi enni khi tak bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="SNG 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 3:4" />Nami laiklow chur klowpchow now ang kowh klanguüa kowi ang khita khai!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 3:4">Aia kowi dow au kowh kim lak kowi uang pawla dowi mowr ang plawtah dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 3:4">aia kowi dow ang uang penla mih kim lak kowi ang uang pawla khai.<verse eid="SNG 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 3:5" />Aw Jerusalem masiuüa, ngahiu hai dowm kowi kowh naki ming rükla se ang tek khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 3:5">akhin taka dowi mowr dow hang cham tanau büa diah.<verse eid="SNG 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Jerusalem masiuüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 3:6" />Süngrüp süngkangma hownia maikhük iowng chunglung mih iawng uaimang mih mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 3:6">Paingbawng hai nam iungma mih chap maten hown uaimang mih mia chow?<verse eid="SNG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 3:7" />Mü diah! Paimi dow mang Sawlawmawn kowh masi pawk müa kim cha chekhai!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 3:7">Nami masi pawk müa kim cha riaret kowi dow tasen kiakma mih siphai uowi 60 ia chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 3:7">amatni dow Israel pren kowi kowh tasen kiakma miuüa chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 3:8" />Amatni tut-e dow saidawng uowi bowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 3:8">amatni dow tasen kiakma kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 3:8">Amatni dow kelang kowi saidawng suama kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 3:8">iak-e maru ngak nauang sen pami rakowi amatni dow kamrütma uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 3:9" />Nami kim cha dow aia vüi mang Sawlawmawn thawpah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 3:9">Nami dow Lebanawn hungh kowi kowh sidar singh hown aia thawpah mih chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 3:10" />Nami masi pawk müa kim cha khawk dow tai hown aia thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 3:10">now aluk dow kuh hown aia thawpah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 3:10">Nakowi kowh chowm rah dow mintau pau rawng uanh hown aia dauah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 3:10">Jerusalem malauüa dow aia kowi naukhi-ah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 3:10">Naiawng rakowi amatni dow nami kim chah lak kowi krawi thawp pe bawng khai.<verse eid="SNG 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Masiuüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 3:11" />Aw Zaiawn chamauüa, uang lawt büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 3:11">mang lukruk krukma mang Sawlawmawn uowi mih mü büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 3:11">Nami mang lukruk dow a-u kruk pe mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 3:11">Nami dow aia paw masi khe hai piaw khe kowh a-u kruk pe mih chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 3:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="SNG 4" />
  <para style="sp">Klanguüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 4:1" />Aw ang kowh manau, en klangiung lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:1">en dow lainowmma klangiung khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 4:1">Lumowr khu müa uan takra kowi en kowh mik mih uatur iawng klangiungma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:1">en kowh sam dawng krang dow Gilead süng hownia kowh uang dowm mih rua hawmh iawng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 4:2" />En kowh iüngün dow ki kepla pawi kowh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:2">uang mang tuiluk mih ruapurma iawng akawma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 4:2">Amatni kowh dow achum uowi bowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:2">lowkchow paw tama dowi chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 4:3" />En kowh ve dow aringma mih la iang iawng aringma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:3">en kowh nawr dow lainowmma klangiung chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 4:3">Lumowr khu müa uan takra kowi en kowh awm mih dalim uih pra iawng aringma chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 4:4" />En kowh ngawng dow mang David kowh kimkrowng iawng klangiungma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:4">nami dow kimkrowng lak kowi kowh siphaiuüa kowh kawngma tabat 1,000 klüng mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 4:5" />En kowh downgprang chak dow lainowmma klangiung chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:5">Nami dow lili pau khang kowi kowh ngahiu chah phir taw mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 4:6" />Uar thowi dowi mowr dow nam iungma mih hungh kowi ang kowkowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:6">now aiiu powt dowi mowr dow maikhük kangowh mih hungh kowi ang nauowi kown.<verse eid="SNG 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 4:7" />Aw ang kowh manau, en kowh dow kow ru klangiungma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:7">en dow amün ama uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 4:8" />Aw ang kowh masi, Lebanawn hownia ang tut-e uang bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:8">Lebanawn hungh hownia ang tut-e uang plan bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 4:8">Amana hungh chut hownia ang tut-e uang dowm bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:8">now Senir hai Hermawn hungh hownia ang tut-e uang dowm bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 4:8">Krangsi khawng hownia ang tut-e uang bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:8">now pri rengchow uowi rah hownia ang tut-e uang bowt.<verse eid="SNG 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 4:9" />Aw ang kowh malauüa, ang kowh masi, en dow pawta ang sak khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:9">en kowh mik mük hai en kowh kuh leng hown en rupta ang sak khai.<verse eid="SNG 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 4:10" />Aw ang kowh malauüa, ang kowh masi, en kowh sakraura dow pe piaw ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 4:10">En kowh sakraura dow grep tui lak-e paw lang iung khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:10">nam iungma mih chap maten lak-e paw en dow lang nam iung chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 4:11" />Aw ang kowh masi, en kowh ve dow kuai tui iawng adingma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:11">en dai krüa kowi dow kuai tui hai iawn tui uowi mih iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 4:11">En kowh tawnguat nam dow Lebanawn hungh kowi kowh sidar singh nam iawng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 4:12" />Aw ang kowh malauüa, ang kowh masi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:12">en dow tap tapat lut mih bakan iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 4:12">En dow pitta hüah mih tuikuam iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:12">en dow owngta hüah mih mrawng tui iawng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 4:13" />En dow klangiungma mih dalim bakan iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:13">nakowi dow aiung aiungma mih uih-ak uowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:13">now chapan singh hai nam iungma mih ruih paw uowi chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 4:14" />Nami klen kowi nakowi dow nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa singh chap paw uowi bowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:14">naiawngün dow naingsa singh, than singh, pruk singh hai singh ding singh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 4:14">Nami klen kowi paw nam iungma mih sau singh, sasua singh hai nam iung mih singh chap maten paw uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 4:15" />En dow bakan kowi kowh tuikuam iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:15">en dow tui awr ue phunglung mih tuikuam iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 4:15">En dow Lebanawn hownia kowh uang hawr mih tui iawng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Malauüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 4:16" />Aw tawngphak hai mrawkphak li, uang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:16">ang kowh bakan luk kowi uang krawi uang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 4:16">Nahanow nami bakan kowi kowh uih nam dow nakrawi tauet kown towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:16">Ang kowh klanguüa ow, en kowh bakan kowi uang bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 4:16">now nakowi kowh uih lang iung mih uang krawi tang bowt.<verse eid="SNG 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="SNG 5" />
  <para style="sp">Klanguüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 5:1" />Aw ang kowh manau, ang kowh masi, ang kowh bakan kowi ang uang kup khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:1">now nam iungma mih sau hai nam iungma mih chap ang krawi kua khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 5:1">Kuaiba hai kuai tui ang cha khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:1">grep tui hai iawn tui paw ang kham khowk.</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 5:1">Jerusalem malauüa hawm kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 5:1">Aw malauüa hai klanguüa, cha iüah kham iüa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:1">enchi kowh tasakraura asowrma sunah iüa diah.<verse eid="SNG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Malauüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 5:2" />Ang müi chepaw ang kowh sak dow achingma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:2">Nakhowk khe ang kowh klanguüa klow hai uang khik ang kimbüng mih klow ang ta khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 5:2">Aia tek ang mih, “Ang kowh masi, ang kowh manau, en dow ang kowh uatur chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:2">en dow angak uowi dowi mih ang kowh malauüa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 5:2">Uang ho ang kimbüng diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:2">nang tui hown ang kowh lu sik khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:2">iak-e kowh mai hown ang kowh sam sik khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="SNG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 5:3" />Nakhowk khe sakdawng kowi ang tatek mih, “Ang dow klüpta dawnguan khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:3">tawng iawng chow ang naplan khupah iawk kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 5:3">Ang sauta khawk khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:3">tawng iawng chow ang naplan lawiah iawk kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="SNG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 5:4" />Ang kowh klanguüa dow uang klowt kimbüng kownkow kimbüng kua hownia uai suang rut khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:4">aia kowi prüa lai bowt kowh ang kowh sak mih ngawi prang towbowt.<verse eid="SNG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 5:5" />Ang dow ang kowh klanguüa kowi kowuow pe kimbüng kownkow awr rü khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:5">nakhowk khe ang kowh rut dow nam iungma mih sau hown sikklawpma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:5">now ang rut kowi kowh sau hown dow kimbüng klia müa sik khai.<verse eid="SNG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 5:6" />Ang kowh klanguüa vüi ang uow pe kim chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:6">Tawkche aia dow powt khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:6">Naiawng rakowi lainowmma ang sak nga khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 5:6">Aia kowi ang krawi chamah chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:6">Tawkche aia kowi ang krum dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 5:6">Aia kowi ang krawi hawah chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:6">Tawkche aia dow klang ang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 5:7" />Kangchawng miuüa marow kowi krawi chawng kang mih khin khe khita ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:7">now amatni dow nüla ang chawkkrawma kowh bawpta ang nak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 5:7">Marow kowi kowh tap chawng miuüa paw ang kowh lumowr khu müa uan rupta ang khai.<verse eid="SNG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 5:8" />Aw Jerusalem masiuüa, enni che ang kowh klanguüa kowi khi hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:8">“Ang naukhi en lai bowt kowh ang kowh kow uak khai bowt,” pape diah.<verse eid="SNG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Jerusalem masiuüa hawm kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 5:9" />Aw lang klangiung mih malauüa, akeng mih klanguüa lak-e en kowh klanguüa tawng iawng chow lang klangiung?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:9">Tawngplawng kowchow maiawng en krawi tukma anging laiklow khai?<verse eid="SNG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Malauüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 5:10" />Ang kowh klanguüa kowh lumowr dow klangiung krang sat iawng tawk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:10">now aia kowh pik mia dow asüama chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 5:10">Aia dow 10,000 ia klanguüa pungmadawng kowi kowh lang klangiung mih chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 5:11" />Aia kowh lu dow achangma mih kuh iawng klangiungma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:11">aia kowh sam dow akünma panow uaak iawng aingma chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 5:12" />Aia kowh mik dow aw pang kowi kaurawng uatur uowi achum mih iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:12">aia kowh mik dow iawn tui kowi sauah mih asung khakma mih hua iawng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 5:13" />Aia kowh awm dow nam iungma mih bakan iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:13">nami hownia dow nam iung uang tauet reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 5:13">Aia kowh ve dow anam krawi tauet khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:13">nami nam dow lili pau nam iawng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 5:14" />Aia kowh rut dow kuh raitua iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:14">Nami dow tow pe Oniks hua mih raitua iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 5:14">Aia kowh kow dow asung khakma mih hua hown kowh tawngah mih iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:14">nami kow klangiung krang dow sawkta hüah mih ngasai sa iawng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 5:15" />Aia kowh thung dow asung khakma mih hua chüng iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:15">Nami dow achangma mih kuh chüng luk kowi kowh chowkta hüah mih hua iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 5:15">Aia kowh powm dow Lebanawn hungh kowi kowh sidar singh iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:15">Nami dow lang klangiung mih sidar singh iawng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 5:16" />Aia kowh nawr dow lainowmma ding chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:16">aia dow pabuk pakowma klangiungma kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 5:16">Aw Jerusalem masiuüa, aia dow ang kowh klanguüa chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 5:16">aia dow ang kowh auiua chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 5:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="SNG 6" />
  <para style="sp">Jerusalem malauüa hawm kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 6:1" />Aw malauüa klangiung, en kowh klanguüa tawng kowi chow cham kowi khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:1">Aia dow tawng mih tiama prakowi chow cham mang mih tek diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:1">nahanow aia kowi dow en hown anging natawi ia cham kown towbowt.<verse eid="SNG 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Malauüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 6:2" />Ang kowh klanguüa dow aia kowh nam iungma mih bakan kowi kowkowi khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:2">Aia dow bakan kowi krawi len hanow krawi klek lili pau khai.<verse eid="SNG 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 6:3" />Ang kowh klanguüa dow ang kowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:3">ang dow aia kowh malauüa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 6:3">Aia dow lili pau khang kowi thing ruapur khai.<verse eid="SNG 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Klanguüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 6:4" />Aw ang kowh manau, en dow Tirza marow iawng klangiungma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:4">en dow Jerusalem marow iawng klangiungma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 6:4">En kowh klangiungra dow ruang <char style="w">tamkhuown</char> mih siphaiuüa iawng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 6:5" />En kowh mik mük dow ang hownia cham plengta diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh mik dow piakta ang sak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 6:5">En kowh sam dawng krang dow Gilead süng hownia kowh uang dowm mih rua hawmh iawng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 6:6" />En kowh iüngün dow uang mang tui luk mih ruapurma iawng akawma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:6">amatni kowh dow achum uowi bowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:6">lowkchow paw tama dowi chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 6:7" />Lumowr khu müa uan takra kowi en kowh awm mih aringma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:7">nami dow dalim uih pra iawng aringma chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 6:8" />Mang kowh dow amasi 60 ia hai changla masi mih narma 80 ia uowi chepaw naia kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:8">now manau akawmma uowi chepaw naia kown.<verse eid="SNG 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 6:9" />Tawkche ang dow lowk iachow kowi chowtaih ang naukhi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:9">aia dow ang kowh klangiungma mih kaurawng uatur chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 6:9">aia iawng mih malauüa dow amiapaw uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 6:9">Aia dow a-u kowh chama lowkchow mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:9">aia kowi dow a-u lainowmma sakrauah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 6:9">Masiuüa hawmh dow aia kowi prasira uowima pahai tek pe reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:9">now mang masiuüa hai changla masi mih narma hawmh paw aia kowi kiowah reng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 6:10" />Amatni tek mih, “Uar thowi iawng uang tatüng mih nami masiuüa mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:10">Lama iawng klangiungma mih nami masiuüa mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 6:10">Sat iawng tawk mih nami masiuüa mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:10">Ruang tamkhuown mih siphai hawmh iawng klangiungma mih nami masiuüa mia chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="SNG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Malauüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 6:11" />Ang dow lawngrawi kowi pau thar khowk chünchü mih nauang mü kownkow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:11">grep ruih kowi pau chen uowi khowk chünchü mih nauang mü kownkow,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 6:11">now dalim singh kowi pau thar khowk chünchü mih nauang mü kownkow</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 6:11">madam süng kowi ang uang mih chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 6:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">6:12 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Mami uan kowi kowh laiklow mih Hebrai lai hown mapaw chim dowi chekhai.</char>
    </note> Ang dow mang kowh kawrnga kari kowi chowm khe kowh iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:12">awmrawm lai kowh sak thü dukluk khai.<verse eid="SNG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Auiuauüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 6:13" />Aw Sulam chenchap malauüa, uang plan bowt, uang plan bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:13">lainowmma anging khi en kown nau khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:13">Naiawng rakowi uang plan bowt, uang plan bowt.</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 6:13">Klanguüa kowh laiklow<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Klanguüa kowh laiklow </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami mia chow tek mih chim dowi chekhai, now nami maru kowh laiklow paw auan tawng chow mih tukah dowi chekhai.</char></note>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 6:13">Aw amün ama uowi dowi mih malauüa, uang plan bowt, uang plan bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 6:13">lainowmma ang khi en kown ang nau khowk.<verse eid="SNG 6:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="SNG 7" />
  <para style="sp">Klanguüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 7:1" />Aw mang chama, en dow phanaikhawk krua lahawm lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 7:1">en kowh thung dow rut tua chapma mih maru thawpah mih kuh uanh iawng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 7:2" />En kowh daikhu dow alumma mih bia iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 7:2">nami bia kowi dow grep tui atungma uowi reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 7:2">En kowh mu dow püm chun iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 7:2">nami chun kowi dow lili pau tapat lut chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 7:3" />En kowh downgprang chak dow lainowmma klangiung khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 7:3">Nami dow ngahiu chah phir taw mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 7:4" />En kowh ngawng dow ngasai sa hown kowh thawpah mih kimkrowng iawng klangiungma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 7:4">en kowh mik dow Bat-Rabim tapplawt re-e kowh Hesbawn marow kowi kowh kanh iawng klangiungma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 7:4">En kowh nakawng dow Damaska marow prakowi dang mih kimkrowng iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 7:4">Nami dow Lebanawn hungh kowi kowh chü lowlow mih kimkrowng iawng aklangma chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 7:5" />En kowh lu dow Karmel hungh iawng klangiungma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 7:5">en kowh sam dow mintau pau rawng uan iawng tawk pliplip chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 7:5">en kowh sam sui kowi dow mang kowh mik taia khai.<verse eid="SNG 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 7:6" />Aw ang kowh malauüa, en dow ang kowh piawra chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 7:6">en dow lainowmma klangiung khai.<verse eid="SNG 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 7:7" />En dow chekmarawng singh iawng akroma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 7:7">en kowh downgprang chak dow grep uih pre pawt mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 7:8" />Ang tek mih, “Chekmarawng singh kowi ang naklaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 7:8">now aia kowh uih dow ang nadowk kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 7:8">En kowh downgprang chak dow grep pawt iawng pacham phaw lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 7:8">en kowh sak hü nam dow apel uih nam iawng pacham phaw lah.<verse eid="SNG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 7:9" />Now en kowh nawr dow lang iung mih grep tui iawng pacham phaw lah.</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 7:9">Malauüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 7:9">En nam ang mih dow grep tui lang iung mih iawng pacham chowng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 7:9">nami dow ang kowh ve hai iüng kowi pacham taplik lah.<verse eid="SNG 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 7:10" />Ang kowh klanguüa dow ang kowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 7:10">aia kowh naura dow ang vüi chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aia kowh sakraura malauüa tüng mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 7:11" />Aw ang kowh klanguüa, chu, dowm kowi achi cham kowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 7:11">now chapan pau dawng kowi achi kowiak lah.<verse eid="SNG 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 7:12" />Chu, mur pah grep krum kowi achi kowkowi diah sik;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 7:12">grep ruih kowi pau chen khowk chünchü mih achi kowmü diah sik.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 7:12">Nami grep ruih kowi pau thar khowk chünchü mih achi kowmü diah sik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 7:12">now dalim singh kowi pau awr pau khowk chünchü mih achi kowmü diah sik.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 7:12">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nakowi dow ang kowh sakraura ang nape en kown.<verse eid="SNG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 7:13" />Chah kak uih nam dow krawi tauet khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 7:13">a-ai hai amin aiung aiungma mih uih maten dow achi kimplawt re-e uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 7:13">Aw ang kowh klanguüa, naiawngün dow en vüi kowi kowh ang tow en mih chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 7:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="SNG 8" />
  <para style="s">Amanau kowi malauüa prüaah mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 8:1" />Owh, au iawn kham mih ang kowh rakmow iawng en chowng khai panü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:1">prang kowi ang krum en chepaw ang naia nam en diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 8:1">Amia iawng mih maru paw tawngpaw naia tek ang kown nadowi diah.<verse eid="SNG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 8:2" />En kowi dow au kim kowi ang nauang ia pawla en diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:2">now nakowi changlawng plawngnau laiklow en naia tüngsang ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 8:2">En kowi dow nam iungma mih chap hown rawah mih grep tui ang nape kham en diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:2">now ang kowh adingma mih dalim uih tui paw ang nape kham en diah.<verse eid="SNG 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 8:3" />Aia kowh lakuai rut kowi dow ang nüa lu khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:3">now aia kowh hawmlawm rut hown dow dawi ang khai.<verse eid="SNG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 8:4" />Aw Jerusalem masiuüa, ang takham se ang tek enni khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:4">akhin taka dowi mowr dow hang cham tanau büa diah.<verse eid="SNG 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Jerusalem malauüa hawm kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 8:5" />Aia kowh klanguüa luk kowi takhemla se</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:5">süngrüp süngkangma hownia uang haimang mih mia chow?</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 8:5">Malauüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 8:5">Apel singh tut kowi en müi mih khin khe ang krüng en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:5">kimuowi mu rauma hown en u pen en mih dow nami arah re-e chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 8:6" />En kowh sak kowi dow mur tuk ia iawng tow ang reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:6">now en rut kowi paw mur tuk iawng tow ang reng diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 8:6">Tawngplawng kowchow panow tanaukhira dow kowng kowi ia town dowi mih iawng akürma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:6">tanaukhira dow kowng iawng chur uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 8:6">Tasakraura hownia kaah mih arau dow maih iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:6">Nami dow maih maten den lak-e lang den chekhai.<verse eid="SNG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 8:7" />Tuikling mangma tui hown paw tanaura mih nowngia mit dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:7">aw tui hown paw nami tanaura mih nowngia nawmla dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 8:7">Dawngthawnguan maten hown ran sakraura kown kamrüt mih dow maru maten sui mih lup naown kown.<verse eid="SNG 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Malauüa kowh rakmauüa laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 8:8" />A-i kowh tuamow sawi uowi lowk ia chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:8">aia kowh downgprang chak dow iuk dowi tak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 8:8">Aia hown che maru tachawng kown nau khai hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:8">tawng chow aia vüi a-i nachang pe kown?<verse eid="SNG 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 8:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8:9 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Mami uan kowi kowh laiklow Hebrai lai hown arui uowi mih lainowmma tukta krat chekhai.</char>
    </note> Aia che chowng tap khai panü</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:9">aia luk kowi tai hown alowngma mih kimkrowng a-i nathawp pe diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 8:9">Aia che chowng kimbüng khai panü</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:9">aia luk kowi a-i nathawp pe abawng diah.<verse eid="SNG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Malauüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 8:10" />Ang dow tap iawng chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:10">Tawkche kawmat dow ang kowh downgprang chak alowngma mih hungh iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 8:10">Naiawng rakowi ang kowh klanguüa dow aia kowi ang naia peah sak-ihra kown mih iawng khi ang khai.<verse eid="SNG 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 8:11" />Mang Sawlawmawn kowh dow Baal-Hamawn pami arah kowi grep krum uowi lowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:11">aia dow nami grep krum mih akeng mih maru tut-e pawngah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:11">now nami grep krum chang miuüa dow lowk ia kowi tai 1,000 iun chi aia kowi uang pawla pe khai.<verse eid="SNG 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 8:12" />Ang kowh grep krum dow ang nau iawng ang nowng pe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:12">nami grep krum vüi tai 1,000 iun Sawlawmawn apek takla dowi tham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:12">Tawkche grep krum khet miuüa kowi tai 200 iun ang napeah kown.<verse eid="SNG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Klanguüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 8:13" />Aw ang kowh manau, en dow bakan kowi uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:13">en auiuauüa dow en kowh klow ta reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="SNG 8:13">Naiawng rakowi ang kowi paw en kowh klow pe tala ang dit snow.<verse eid="SNG 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Malauüa kowh laiklow:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 8:14" />Aw ang kowh manau, uang haimang bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="SNG 8:14">nam iungma mih hungh luk kowi kowh ngahiu hai naki chah iawng uang haimang bowt.<verse eid="SNG 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 8" />
</usx>